{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_00_015_23_5_00_015_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a3f8579f422a63ad65d4050ec09dee336e0efdbb78de45b618916a79b453845c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_00_015_23_5_00_015_23:5_00_015_23:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9aa3f33847174b2761ec597d7a9327c08a62ec256377b6ad165a95d792cbd75",
      "text": "岁末以来的重聚",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_015_23_5_00_015_23:5_00_015_23:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34e73cd896f66dd802cdba9d0abbc85b94874a2227efaa28d45e9d9882865b4c",
      "text": "迎来了新年的315 Production。\n偶像们换上崭新的心情，\n与制作人互致问候。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_015_23_5_00_015_23:5_00_015_23:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b9ff57c97fc88efe0c279cc05f2974860f6d0ef9916f155bee485f4cc0a36e5",
      "text": "新年快乐，\n制作人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_015_23_5_00_015_23:5_00_015_23:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0db801e7e2a2f6b8ad20711ba7790048aa72e8ed543d87f6523eb43de9b55d87",
      "text": "啊啊，新年快乐。\n今年也请多关照了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_015_23_5_00_015_23:5_00_015_23:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7dd6bd026aeb87977ad43a2484cd037b9b3f8a5a125c875da16d42d233fb0ba",
      "text": "制作人，新年快乐～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_015_23_5_00_015_23:5_00_015_23:cmd-000042:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab11cfb33245ceec1b91f34b33b3fb44dce553a6967caeb4fcf9b7db9b9755ec",
      "text": "新年快乐！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_015_23_5_00_015_23:5_00_015_23:cmd-000043:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab741847666f7669c5dcdcf7883547dfec288784de8da99ea0a6a5b7a4853f12",
      "text": "今年也请多多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_015_23_5_00_015_23:5_00_015_23:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f6ffe6678dbb6769212a73fbb5bcd76be2a83fd7009d9a1f9cadc9206227ab2",
      "text": "好的！\n各位的新年过得怎么样呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_015_23_5_00_015_23:5_00_015_23:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c420a932a9f5449ac2ac677e4a0dc270fd0bb255546aed5bd14eb9bbd8d47bd",
      "text": "都说正月头三天不要打扫卫生嘛。\n忍着不去打扫可憋坏我了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_015_23_5_00_015_23:5_00_015_23:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7e3cc9f0864c800dc1ac34742ae4c3e458ed4b07f22a6b9e0c93b0627f455ac",
      "text": "闲卧迎新春，静听冬之音。\n我过年的时候，是在家里悠闲度过的哦～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_015_23_5_00_015_23:5_00_015_23:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:002a3090f8d8a6540cff6b3b54523343d9f3a01f4583278d8dec2ee338892a87",
      "text": "古论和制作人过得怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_015_23_5_00_015_23:5_00_015_23:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f75d446adc8ea4fcf9bb0481408c163d20bf7773a73e9cfc60b264e1afddf88",
      "text": "我去海边看了新年日出。之后，\n和家里人像往年一样度过了新年哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_015_23_5_00_015_23:5_00_015_23:cmd-000083:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05d2b584e10cedf032eb42ca5ccb796bf60e90f25405c19f212ba90278404496",
      "text": "悠闲睡大觉度过的",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_015_23_5_00_015_23:5_00_015_23:cmd-000084:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6db2598f523372425022ffd96fde6673a7621211fbfb631db446ed90d2875a3c",
      "text": "和往常一样",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_015_23_5_00_015_23:5_00_015_23:cmd-000085:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4adabb1c49e4663fc1ddd7466b51586e5d4574af93656fdaee1b991c77ece11",
      "text": "正月头三天忍着没碰家务水洗",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_015_23_5_00_015_23:5_00_015_23:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fafbf796d8d7f57dcd363f1becabe6a51eb44eafa40a2afb2c02cd90cb2d23b3",
      "text": "跟我一样呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_015_23_5_00_015_23:5_00_015_23:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:872f627d165a65fae5f4be6e701886cb015afa3c2b1a5df71192ee29e4643371",
      "text": "跟我一样呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_015_23_5_00_015_23:5_00_015_23:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4d5e13a54dd173000a89674210efdd339107a792893d2e46370e1c6b78530b5",
      "text": "跟我过得差不多啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_015_23_5_00_015_23:5_00_015_23:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8dcd18e23015decc2ebf955ccbdef37bf3996a913cef15429199cbe0ee38eda5",
      "text": "话虽如此，像这样大家聚在一起碰面，\n今年还是头一回呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_015_23_5_00_015_23:5_00_015_23:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a09edaebe422cbf8e400ac1ad7ebf6adc4b2036f6ea42f4fd01df442e1f808b9",
      "text": "是啊。毕竟这是今年的第一份工作呢。\n今年也想和各位一起努力奋斗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_015_23_5_00_015_23:5_00_015_23:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aefe91798d46f7c7334364bd8f8d19eadfb200d681e97baf7d433acb42065b2d",
      "text": "嘛，新的一年也按照我们的步调慢慢来吧。\n接下来也请多关照了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_015_23_5_00_015_23:5_00_015_23:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ee270b9acb4dd35ab9ebd0eb64afd5e536e27e08ff3d161ee7826fabab2186f",
      "text": "嗯。克里斯先生、雨彦先生，还有\n制作人也是。今年也请多关照咯～",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
